{"hymn":"S879","parent":"E1058","quality":"exact","adjust":{"hold":0,"merge":0},"title":"Roca de la eternidad","subtitle":"El evangelio—Clamar al Señor","syl":{"n1":["Ro","i"],"n2":["ca","t"],"n3":"de","n4":["la‿e","i"],"n5":["ter","m"],"n6":["ni","m"],"n7":["dad","t"],"n8":"Que","n9":"por","n10":["mí‿hen","i"],"n11":["di","m"],"n12":["das","t"],"n13":["es","i"],"n14":["tás;","t"],"n15":"Tu","n16":["cos","i"],"n17":["ta","m"],"n18":["do","t"],"n19":"se","n20":["ras","i"],"n21":["gó","t"],"n22":["San","i"],"n23":["gre","t"],"n24":["y‿a","i"],"n25":["gua‿a","m"],"n26":["llí","t"],"n27":["flu","i"],"n28":["yó,","t"],"n29":["Dan","i"],"n30":["do","t"],"n31":["do","i"],"n32":["ble","t"],"n33":["sa","i"],"n34":["ni","m"],"n35":["dad","t"],"n36":"Por","n37":"las","n38":["cul","i"],"n39":["pas","t"],"n40":"y‿el","n41":["pe","i"],"n42":["car.","t"]},"verses":[{"label":"2.","lines":["Aunque obre hasta el fin","No podré Tu ley cumplir;","Aunque sirva sin parar,","Aunque llore sin cesar,","Nada me podrá salvar,","Mas por gracia Tú lo harás."]},{"label":"3.","lines":["Nada tengo que ofrecer,","A Tu cruz me aferraré;","Vísteme, desnudo estoy,","Desvalido a Ti yo voy,","A la fuente acudiré","Lávame o moriré."]},{"label":"4.","lines":["Cuando tenga que expirar,","Y mis ojos ya cerrar,","Cuando frente al trono esté","Para allí comparecer,","Roca hendida para mí,","Déjame esconderme en Ti."]}]}